 "lines": [
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 76.4,
   "en": "…for [Game 5], our son Walker,",
   "ko": "5차전 때 아들 워커가",
   "to": 78.9
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 78.92,
   "en": "who was [17 months old] at the time, became very ill.",
   "ko": "17개월이었는데, 많이 아팠어요.",
   "to": 81.9
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 82.88,
   "en": "My wife Shannon rushed him to the hospital",
   "ko": "아내가 급히 병원에 데려갔더니"
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 84.56,
   "en": "where he was diagnosed with [type 1 diabetes].",
   "ko": "1형 당뇨 진단이 나왔어요.",
   "to": 86.2
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 87.3,
   "en": "It was as if a rug was pulled from underneath us.",
   "ko": "발밑이 꺼지는 것 같았어요."
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 90.84,
   "en": "[Life as we knew it was over].",
   "ko": "우리가 알던 삶은 끝났죠.",
   "to": 92.0
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 93.62,
   "en": "Even though just a few days later we finished our journey",
   "ko": "며칠 뒤 6차전에서 이기고"
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 96.7,
   "en": "winning Game 6 and being crowned an [NBA champion],",
   "ko": "NBA 챔피언이 됐는데도요.",
   "to": 98.9
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 178.58,
   "en": "So we wake up [every two hours] throughout the night",
   "ko": "그래서 매일 밤 2시간마다 일어나"
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 181.14,
   "en": "on the clock to check Walker's blood sugars.",
   "ko": "워커 혈당을 재요.",
   "to": 183.3
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 184.5,
   "en": "Shannon and I often joke that we are [vampires].",
   "ko": "아내와 저는 우리가 뱀파이어라고 농담해요."
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 186.52,
   "en": "Neither one of us has slept through the night in [five years].",
   "ko": "5년 동안 둘 다 밤새 푹 자 본 적이 없거든요.",
   "to": 188.85
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_b.mp4",
   "at": 30.14,
   "en": "And his brothers run outside and go play,",
   "ko": "형제들은 밖에 나가 노는데"
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_b.mp4",
   "at": 33.06,
   "en": "and he has to [stay behind], he has to take a shot,",
   "ko": "워커는 남아서 주사를 맞아야 해요.",
   "to": 35.02
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_b.mp4",
   "at": 35.48,
   "en": "and he looks at us and he says,",
   "ko": "그러고는 우리를 보며 말하죠."
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_b.mp4",
   "at": 37.32,
   "en": "you know, \"When is this going to end?",
   "ko": "\"이거 언제 끝나요?"
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_b.mp4",
   "at": 39.36,
   "en": "When can we [stop doing this]?\"",
   "ko": "언제 그만할 수 있어요?\"",
   "to": 40.9
  },
  {
   "who": 0,
   "src": "celeb/allen_a.mp4",
   "at": 382.42,
   "en": "We have to, because together we are [a winning team].",
   "ko": "꼭 이겨야죠. 우린 함께라서 이기는 팀이니까요.",
   "to": 384.8
  }
 ],
 "keys": [
